  "_meta": {
    "_comment": "Source-of-truth English strings for Soul Link. Keys are dot-separated and grouped by surface. Add a key here first, then mirror it (with translation) into other locale files. Top-level keys starting with '_' are ignored at load time. Placeholders use {0}, {1} ordering."
  },

